[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - A is the source, so all nodes reachable from A are descendants.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m   - A -> C, A -> D → C and D are descendants of A.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m   - B is not reachable from A in the graph (A -> C, A -> D, B -> C). So B is not a descendant of A.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m   - Thus, B:0, C:1, D:1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m So the result is:  
