[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - B is a downstream of A (A -> B): B:1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - C is a downstream of B (B -> C): C:1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - D is not reachable from A, B, or C: D:0.
