[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m    - D is not a descendant of A (no path from A to D), so D:0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m    - **Consistent.**
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 2. **Perturb(C) -> A:1 B:1 C:0 D:1**
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m    - C is perturbed, so C:0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m    - A is a descendant of C (C->A), so A:1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m    - B is a descendant of C (C->B), so B:1.
