[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 3. **Perturb(D) -> A:1 B:1 C:0 D:0**
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m    - D is perturbed, so D:0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m    - A is a descendant of D (D->A), so A:1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m    - B is a descendant of D (D->B), so B:1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m    - C is not a descendant of D (no path from D to C), so C:0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m    - **Consistent.**
