[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m ### Step 1: Understand the perturbation observations
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - **Perturb(B) -> A:0 B:0 C:0 D:0**  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m   This means:  
