[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - B is perturbed, so B is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - A: Is A a descendant of B? Yes, since B->A is an edge (B is upstream of A). So A is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - C: Is C a descendant of B? No. B->D, C->B, but C is upstream of B. So C is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - D: Is D a descendant of B? Yes, since B->D is an edge. So D is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m **Result:** A:1, B:0, C:0, D:1 → consistent with the observation.
