[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - D: Is D a descendant of C? No. C->D is an edge, but D is not a descendant of C. It is a direct child of B. So D is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m **Result:** A:1, B:1, C:0, D:1 → consistent with the observation.
