[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - C->D
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m So the reachability is:
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - A is upstream of B, C, D.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - B is upstream of C, D.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - C is upstream of D.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m So any node reachable from A is: A, B, C, D (all are reachable from A).  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m Any node reachable from B is: B, C, D.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m Any node reachable from C is: C, D.  
