[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - A is perturbed, so A is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - B is not a descendant of A (since A has no edge to B), so B is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - C is not a descendant of A (since A has no edge to C), so C is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - D is not a descendant of A, so D is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m **Result**: A:0, B:0, C:0, D:0 → matches the observation.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
