[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m ---
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m ### 3. **Perturb(D)** -> A:1, B:0, C:1, D:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
