[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m **Candidate graph:** A->C, B->C, D->A, D->B
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m ---
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m ### Step 1: Understand the semantics
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - A node is 0 unless it is a downstream descendant of the perturbed node.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - A node is 1 if it is a downstream descendant of the perturbed node.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - A node is 0 otherwise.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - When a node is perturbed, it is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m ---
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m ### Step 2: Analyze each perturbation
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m #### Perturb(A)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - Perturb(A) → A:0 (since A is perturbed)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - A is perturbed, so A is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - Check which nodes are descendants of A:
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m   - A->C (A is upstream of C), so C is a descendant of A.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m   - A has no other edges, so B and D are not descendants of A.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - Therefore, B and D are 0, C is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - Observed: A:0, B:0, C:1, D:0 → matches the observed value: A:0 B:0 C:1 D:0 → **consistent**.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m #### Perturb(B)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - Perturb(B) → B:0 (since B is perturbed)
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - B is perturbed, so B is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - Check which nodes are descendants of B:
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m   - B->C (B is upstream of C), so C is a descendant of B.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m   - B has no other edges, so A, D are not descendants of B.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - Therefore, A and D are 0, C is 1.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - Observed: A:0, B:0, C:1, D:0 → matches the observed value: A:0 B:0 C:1 D:0 → **consistent**.
