[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - So, B:1, D:1 → matches the observation (A:0, B:1, C:0, D:1).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - A is not a descendant of C, so A:0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - ✅ Consistent.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m #### 3. Perturb(D):
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - D is perturbed, so D:0.
