[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m    - Perturb(A) sets A to 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m    - Nodes B, C, D must be 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m    - For B to be 0, it must not be a descendant of A.
