[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - Perturb(C) implies C is perturbed (C:0).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - C is not connected to any other node, so no edges from C.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - Therefore, all nodes are 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - But the observed result is: A:0, B:0, C:0, D:0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - This is consistent with the candidate graph, as C is not connected to any other node.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - **Conclusion**: The observed result is consistent with the candidate graph.
