[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m   - So this is **consistent**.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - **Perturb(D)**: D is the perturbed node, so it should be 0.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m   - D has no edges in the graph, so no downstream nodes.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m   - All nodes are 0.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m   - The observation is consistent: A:0, B:0, C:0, D:0.  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m   - So this is **consistent**.
