[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - C: is C a descendant of B? B->A, A->D, but C is not connected to B or A. So C:0
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - D: is D a descendant of B? B->A, A->D, so D is a descendant of B. D:1
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
