[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - Perturb(C) implies that C is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - C -> A: A is a descendant of C, so A:1 is correct.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - C -> B: B is a descendant of C, so B:1 is correct.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - C -> D: D is not a descendant of C (since there is no edge from C to D), so D:0 is correct.
