[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - Perturb(D) implies that D is 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - D is not a source in the graph. Since there is no edge from D to any other node, no node is a descendant of D. So all nodes are 0.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - The result matches the observation: A:0, B:0, C:0, D:0.
