[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - **Perturb(B)**: A:0, B:0, C:1, D:1  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - **Perturb(C)**: A:0, B:0, C:0, D:1  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - **Perturb(D)**: A:0, B:0, C:0, D:0  
