[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - When B is perturbed, C and D are affected (C:1, D:1).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - When C is perturbed, D is affected (D:1).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - When D is perturbed, no nodes are affected (D:0).
