[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m The candidate graph is `B->C, C->D`.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - **B is upstream of C, and C is upstream of D**.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - So, B is an upstream cause of C, and C is an upstream cause of D.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - Thus, **C and D are descendants of B** (since B -> C -> D).
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m ---
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
