[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - C is perturbed → C:0  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - C is upstream of D → D is a descendant → D:1  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - B is not a descendant of C (B is not reachable from C in the graph) → B:0  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - A is not a descendant of C → A:0  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - So the result is A:0, B:0, C:0, D:1 → matches the observation.
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m 
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m **Case 3: Perturb(D)**  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - D is perturbed → D:0  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - D has no outgoing edges in the graph → no descendants  
[36m(RewardLoopWorker pid=462400)[0m - So all nodes (A, B, C, D) are 0 → matches the observation.
